      },
      {
        "_uid": "4b71a005-63d8-2b2e-6cac-4b9727a8707e",
        "date": "",
        "quote": "Extreme heat is a rapidly growing public health crisis, especially for cities in Pakistan. Given its impact, cities need to have clear action plans with well defined triggers. We look forward to partnering with PDMA and other partners to provide necessary technical support to develop such plans.",
